  <item>
    <title>16 - 从旷野到轨道，我们突然开始追求稳定了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680d0c008aed253fa3ae328d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680d0c008aed253fa3ae328d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Apr 2025 18:36:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不多说了，话都在这期节目里了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 毕业了，同时失去了对世界的愤怒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 时间越紧张，就越想干更多的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 人要给自己很多支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> “努力”这个词让我们又爱又恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 折腾的人生突然让我感觉有点累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 突然理解为什么要买房了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 永远不要在人际关系中浪费时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> 你的人生究竟在追求什么？（短期目标vs长期目标）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3103">51:43</a> 不想上班的人生该怎么过！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 原来游戏和人生真的是一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3633">01:00:33</a> 人生都会自然而然的导向你的内心选择！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Fujii Kaze - Workin’ Hard</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
